82
00:07:25,151 --> 00:07:27,151
We're from the New World!

83
00:07:27,151 --> 00:07:35,151
Those are tits!

84
00:07:35,151 --> 00:07:37,151
Get to the scaven!

85
00:07:42,151 --> 00:07:43,151
How is he?

86
00:07:44,151 --> 00:07:45,151
It isn't good.

87
00:07:45,151 --> 00:07:47,151
First aid isn't going to cut it, I'm afraid.

88
00:07:47,151 --> 00:07:49,151
We gotta get him out of here and fast.

89
00:07:49,151 --> 00:07:51,151
The odds were against him from the start,

90
00:07:51,151 --> 00:07:53,151
