167
00:11:06,411 --> 00:11:17,711
Look, Ace. You can't keep doing this, kiddo.

168
00:11:17,711 --> 00:11:22,571
So your grandson, he's around my age, huh?

169
00:11:22,571 --> 00:11:23,411
Uh-huh.

170
00:11:23,411 --> 00:11:30,831
Do you think he's happy with himself?

171
00:11:30,831 --> 00:11:33,771
