175
00:11:46,971 --> 00:11:50,011
Did I deserve to be born or was it just a mistake?

176
00:11:50,011 --> 00:11:57,751
That's not for me to say.

177
00:11:58,751 --> 00:12:01,651
You just keep living and hope you find out.

178
00:12:08,311 --> 00:12:10,631
Quick, carry Straw Boy back to the ship.

179
00:12:11,771 --> 00:12:15,091
It's not ideal, but we'll have to save Ace Boy without him.

180
00:12:15,091 --> 00:12:28,271
I need one last favor from you.

181
00:12:32,271 --> 00:12:33,831
We're coming for you, Ace.

182
00:12:33,971 --> 00:12:35,411
We're taking you home.

183
00:12:35,771 --> 00:12:37,691
That Navy never stood a chance.

184
00:12:40,311 --> 00:12:41,511
This is wrong.

185
00:12:41,511 --> 00:12:53,851
My friend, don't lose hope.

186
00:12:54,151 --> 00:12:57,471
I swear I shall save your life no matter how much blood it's filled.

187
00:12:57,831 --> 00:12:59,331
We're almost there.

188
00:13:01,071 --> 00:13:02,831
There's no stopping us now.

189
00:13:05,311 --> 00:13:07,791
Don't let them get you down, Ace.

190
00:13:07,991 --> 00:13:09,971
Yeah, we won't leave you.

191
00:13:09,971 --> 00:13:11,931
We're brothers. We stick together.

192
00:13:15,231 --> 00:13:16,711
Dammit, this is all wrong.

193
00:13:17,291 --> 00:13:19,031
How the hell am I supposed to feel?

194
00:13:19,971 --> 00:13:21,871
Pops, Luffy, my friends.

195
00:13:22,271 --> 00:13:23,531
They're here to save me,

196
00:13:23,631 --> 00:13:26,711
but they're pushing through a sea of their own blood to do it.

197
00:13:27,171 --> 00:13:28,851
Don't say one last anything.

198
00:13:29,091 --> 00:13:30,851
We're getting out of here alive, darn it.

199
00:13:33,211 --> 00:13:35,071
You know what I need.

200
00:13:35,471 --> 00:13:35,711
Hmm?

201
00:13:35,711 --> 00:13:38,071
I'm sick.

202
00:13:39,451 --> 00:13:41,251
These are tears of joy.

203
00:13:43,891 --> 00:13:45,691
Even after all I've done,

204
00:13:46,211 --> 00:13:48,851
I want to live.

205
00:13:52,851 --> 00:13:56,451
Eva, help me.

206
00:13:56,451 --> 00:14:00,771
You realize what the repercussions of this would be, don't you?

207
00:14:00,771 --> 00:14:02,131
Uh.

208
00:14:24,591 --> 00:14:25,791
Captain Buggy.

209
00:14:25,791 --> 00:14:26,791
He's awake!

210
00:14:26,791 --> 00:14:27,791
He's alive!

211
00:14:27,791 --> 00:14:29,791
I knew it all along!

212
00:14:29,791 --> 00:14:32,791
Ah, jeez, what happened?

213
00:14:32,791 --> 00:14:33,791
We okay?

214
00:14:33,791 --> 00:14:34,791
Aokiji just froze you solid.

215
00:14:34,791 --> 00:14:35,791
It was really freaky.

216
00:14:42,791 --> 00:14:44,791
Captain Buggy!

217
00:14:44,791 --> 00:14:45,791
Oh, no!

218
00:14:45,791 --> 00:14:47,791
It's too late!

219
00:14:47,791 --> 00:14:48,791
No!

220
00:14:48,791 --> 00:14:50,791
He was so beautiful, so perfect!

221
00:14:50,791 --> 00:14:52,791
He was gonna conquer the world, damn it!

222
00:14:52,791 --> 00:14:53,791
The world!

223
00:14:55,791 --> 00:15:01,791
Oh, no!

224
00:15:09,791 --> 00:15:11,791
He got hit by the ice attack on purpose

225
00:15:11,791 --> 00:15:14,791
so he could show us how to unfreeze everyone else!

226
00:15:14,791 --> 00:15:16,791
Even when he's frozen solid,

227
00:15:16,791 --> 00:15:18,791
he's still thinking of his friends!

228
00:15:18,791 --> 00:15:19,791
Quick!

229
00:15:19,791 --> 00:15:21,791
Let's blow out the other guys before it's too late!

230
00:15:21,791 --> 00:15:22,791
Okay!

231
00:15:22,791 --> 00:15:24,791
Stay drowning over here!

232
00:15:25,791 --> 00:15:28,791
I want to rescue your savior first!

233
00:15:28,791 --> 00:15:30,791
Remember, I can swim!

234
00:15:30,791 --> 00:15:31,791
Help!

235
00:15:32,791 --> 00:15:34,791
Captain Buggy!

236
00:15:34,791 --> 00:15:36,791
We were blinded by your godlike glory

237
00:15:36,791 --> 00:15:39,791
and forgot about the whole devil fruit thing!

238
00:15:39,791 --> 00:15:41,791
You saved us so many times!

239
00:15:41,791 --> 00:15:43,791
And we almost let you down!

240
00:15:43,791 --> 00:15:44,791
I'm sorry!

241
00:15:44,791 --> 00:15:45,791
Sue me!

242
00:15:45,791 --> 00:15:48,791
I'm not omnipotent, but as long as you still worship me,

243
00:15:48,791 --> 00:15:49,791
we're good!

244
00:15:50,791 --> 00:15:54,791
Looks like I've still got my luck and my lackeys!

245
00:15:54,791 --> 00:15:57,791
By the way, where did Mr. Three run off to?

246
00:15:57,791 --> 00:15:58,791
I'm not sure.

247
00:15:58,791 --> 00:16:01,791
The last time we saw him was before those walls trapped us in here

248
00:16:01,791 --> 00:16:03,791
and everything went to hell!

249
00:16:03,791 --> 00:16:06,791
That little rat, he made it out, didn't he?

250
00:16:06,791 --> 00:16:08,791
You mean these walls?

251
00:16:08,791 --> 00:16:10,791
With the cannons?

252
00:16:10,791 --> 00:16:13,791
The Navy lured everyone in, then trapped them with these things.

253
00:16:13,791 --> 00:16:16,791
After that, it was ice and meteors and boiling water,

254
00:16:16,791 --> 00:16:18,791
and, well, we're trapped.

255
00:16:18,791 --> 00:16:20,791
Oh, are we?

256
00:16:20,791 --> 00:16:23,791
Because the great Captain Buggy wouldn't have made it this far in life

257
00:16:23,791 --> 00:16:26,791
if he'd surrendered every time he ran into a measly wall or two.

258
00:16:27,791 --> 00:16:29,791
You hear that, Navy?

259
00:16:29,791 --> 00:16:31,791
Buggy's coming for ya!

260
00:16:31,791 --> 00:16:34,791
No walls, ice, or giant magma fists can stop me!

261
00:16:34,791 --> 00:16:35,791
Awesome!

262
00:16:35,791 --> 00:16:37,791
You've only been defrosted like a couple of minutes,

263
00:16:37,791 --> 00:16:39,791
but you're like, bam, let's do it!

264
00:16:39,791 --> 00:16:40,791
That's how I roll.

265
00:16:41,791 --> 00:16:44,791
Okay, seriously, now what?

266
00:16:44,791 --> 00:16:47,791
Better move, my punk!

267
00:16:48,791 --> 00:17:03,791
Son of a...

268
00:17:03,791 --> 00:17:05,791
Are you okay?

269
00:17:07,791 --> 00:17:10,791
The ravages of time humble us all.

270
00:17:10,791 --> 00:17:12,791
Yes, even you.

271
00:17:12,791 --> 00:17:15,791
Screw the fight, this is what I was afraid of.

272
00:17:15,791 --> 00:17:19,791
I don't want no sympathy.

273
00:17:19,791 --> 00:17:22,791
